        "version": 2,
        "content": "<h2>Example #1</h2><p>Link to source: <a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/device-list-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\">device_list_widget.html</span></a></p><p>Basic example of a LogicMonitor Text/Custom HTML widget using the LogicMonitor Widget SDK. This widget will display a list of devices in alert status, as well as a summary of the number of devices in alert status and the number of alerts that have not cleared.</p><p>SDK commands this script helps demonstrate:</p><ul><li>lm.auth.fromTokens()</li><li>lm.configure()</li><li>lm.context.onReady()</li><li>lm.error()</li><li>lm.getAlerts()</li><li>lm.info()</li><li>lm.query()</li></ul>"
