        "content": "<h2>Instance Browser</h2><p>Link to source:&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/instance-browser-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\"></span></a></strong><a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/instance-browser-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\"></span></a><a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/instance-browser-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\">instance-browser-widget.html</span></a><a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/instance-browser-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\"></span></a><strong><a href=\"https://github.com/logicmonitor/custom_widgets/blob/main/sdk/examples/instance-browser-widget.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 218, 100);\"></span></a></strong></p><p id=\"isPasted\">Example LogicMonitor Text/Custom HTML widget using the LogicMonitor Widget SDK that allows you to pick a resource, then a datasource, then see its instances.</p><p>SDK commands this script helps demonstrate:</p><ul><li>lm.auth.fromTokens()</li><li>lm.configure()</li><li>lm.context.onReady()</li><li>lm.error()</li><li>lm.getDevices()</li><li>lm.getDeviceDataSources()</li><li>lm.getDeviceInstances()</li><li>lm.getStatusColor()</li><li>lm.info()</li></ul>"
